{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0324_1000_005yay", "source_sha256": "53f8f36e07e9ddfed9b8e9d8a09f34ab4d927dd7be3c56b1cf3612d908595dda", "ja": "{$P$}！\nこの衣装、すっごくかわいいです～っ！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n这身服装超级可爱～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0324_1001_p", "source_sha256": "c8a879a88d0463cbe20f6dd9896b3e5d4ef93307dda6dc508e7f27dce3a643b1", "ja": "お、新番組の衣装、\nバッチリ気に入ってくれたみたいだな。", "zh": "哦，看来你很喜欢新节目的服装啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0324_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "0e09d299383c63f5be24a76d2b4c19cd302d2fe6e40295c72df8ac5f7597fcdf", "ja": "はい！　あ、でも、今回のテーマは『妖精』って\n聞いてたから、ちょっとびっくりしました！", "zh": "是的！啊，不过我听说这次的主题是“妖精”，所以还是有点惊讶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0324_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "d2ec7c65fe2a9e3e9534993b82e0baa7e0328a8bf91e7da61fea24cc5d52d346", "ja": "妖精っていうと、もっとふわふわ～キラキラ～ってした\nドレスみたいな感じなのかなーって。", "zh": "说到妖精，我还以为会是更加轻飘飘～闪闪发亮的\n那种像礼服一样的感觉呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0324_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4246cae2333c9e6c0a0645a1b6c87785d5f66550b0c4bb0aae3090ceaa10e21d", "ja": "確かに、妖精ってそんなイメージかもな。でも今回\nやよいは、元気で夜更かしな『いたずら妖精』だから。", "zh": "确实，妖精给人的印象大概就是那样。不过这次\nやよい扮演的是活泼、爱熬夜的\"恶作剧妖精\"。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0324_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "bb1880b967829343e360569c678ce5fbffd4ccdf952349c32d131776429c300d", "ja": "そっか、ドレスじゃいたずらしづらいですもんね。\nこの衣装なら、動きやすさバツグンですっ！", "zh": "这样啊，穿礼服确实不太方便恶作剧呢。\n这身服装行动起来可灵活多了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0324_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2325b1abb1cc435ff2615b31cd36f9a6a21fab1435a67a3d9f4cebc66f98024f", "ja": "ああ、本番もめいっぱい動いて、\n元気にいたずらしまくってくれていいぞ！", "zh": "啊，正式演出时也尽管尽情活动，\n精神满满地恶作剧吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0324_1007_005yay", "source_sha256": "69d0c45615343c0466c3273f24d7f50da69f9286ff88eacff84437976bca0e8e", "ja": "はーい！　……でもそういえば、いたずら妖精って\nどんないたずらをするんでしょう？", "zh": "好——！……不过说起来，恶作剧妖精到底会搞什么样的恶作剧呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0324_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "e7e3cc82a84f79f242e493a8538a30296923a250b7267bc2e13f4f27ad8ac427", "ja": "絵本で見た妖精は、いたずらでみんなを困らせたり\nしてましたけど、私、悪いことはしたくないかも……。", "zh": "绘本里的妖精会恶作剧，把大家弄得很困扰什么的，不过我可能不太想做坏事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0324_1009_p", "source_sha256": "afa4f1d43516b97ed4b0ad51f3765996f9b81c57a91dad667deb9cab6b8cdc2a", "ja": "そうだな……じゃあ困らせるんじゃなくて、\nサプライズするイメージはどうだ？", "zh": "这样啊……那不去捉弄大家，改成给大家一个惊喜，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0324_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "8b90eadf968e2cb948578e2329aa8d95feb3aac8c498ffb411cf740f5881fa52", "ja": "サプライズ、ですか？　\nそれっていたずらになるんでしょうか？", "zh": "惊喜，是吗？\n那算恶作剧吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0324_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b4f37f2da2e0d063fea06c09e98451d3d35163a3ca2144d7f1af332e2116c5e4", "ja": "ああ。びっくりして、思わず笑っちゃうようなことも、\nいたずらって言えると思うぞ。", "zh": "啊。让人吓一跳、忍不住笑出来的事情，我觉得也可以称作恶作剧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0324_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "edb1d16bd3cbe38b22e10bd74f42630eb5eba5fd0766c31e13637c280fde6c6f", "ja": "わぁ、それなら楽しそうです！　みんながわーっ！って\n驚いちゃうこと、私、やってみたいですー！", "zh": "哇，那样听起来很有意思！我想试试看让大家都“哇——！”地吓一跳的事情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0324_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "8d13f58bd669b95cb95a96a285e25b89bc4ff683ed841a4213dbe7d2778a4ffb", "ja": "たとえば……みんなのところに飛んでいって、\n空からお菓子をパラパラ～って降らせるとか……？", "zh": "比如……飞到大家那里，从空中把点心哗啦啦～地撒下来之类的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0324_1014_p", "source_sha256": "8cb97b7c91bbcf081afafc1f940cea6d9ddfbbbabeb6f912068bbbbed89d6e49", "ja": "はは、それはいいな。実際に飛ぶのは難しいけど\nお菓子をばら撒くくらいならできるかも？", "zh": "哈哈，这个不错。虽然实际飞起来有点困难，但撒撒点糖果什么的，说不定还是能做到的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0324_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "23f5dbc7f1d5bfc9fb557a4bb4f7f68d60f35931469c05e3adb6afc237aa5053", "ja": "それなら、お菓子だけじゃなくて、いろんなプレゼント\nを用意したら、もっと驚いてくれそうですね！", "zh": "那样的话，要是准备的不只是点心，还有各种各样的礼物，大家应该会更加惊喜吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0324_1016_005yay", "source_sha256": "42efe36c4276bcf209a11bc1d9be6ed1a482208fb448d49bc1b02470e8118865", "ja": "あとは……あ！　街中で突然ライブを始めるなんて\nどうですか？　きっとみんなびっくりすると思います！", "zh": "还有就是……啊！要是突然在街头办起演唱会\n怎么样？我觉得大家肯定会大吃一惊的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0324_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5ad4bc33c3a215a1e316897f762b090c9a329cc33163d9819b35fae75018981d", "ja": "うん、どれもワクワクするサプライズじゃないか。\nやよいには、いたずら妖精の才能があるな！", "zh": "嗯，每个都是让人期待的惊喜嘛。\n弥生很有成为恶作剧小精灵的天分呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0324_1018_005yay", "source_sha256": "d7937e5774875f1a7f6aadc189c823bba3a645b3da035b533c397be2856d1993", "ja": "えへへ♪　みんなが笑顔になれるように、\nいたずら妖精、い～っぱいがんばりまーすっ！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪为了让大家都露出笑容，\n我会作为恶作剧小精灵，努——力加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
